      "hallucination_observed": false,
      "rationale": "A specificity ordinal is a genuine new axis directly relevant to goal-management practices and achievement. Descriptions vary in specificity, so scores are broadly derivable, though the scoring rubric is opaque and some assignments (e.g. the detailed engagement-program goal scored 1) are questionable, lowering groundedness somewhat."
